The mitmproxy e2e CA and leaf are generated at container start by
`generate_certs.py` into the `mitmproxy-certs` compose volume. They are not
stored in git.

- `/certs/mitmproxy-ca.crt` — CA the Connect worker trusts via `SSL_CERT_FILE`
- `/certs/mitmproxy.pem` — leaf (SAN: mitmproxy, mitmproxy-subdomain) plus
  private key, which mitmproxy `--certs` expects
